  "text": "Design patterns for effective cc-track subagents:\n\n**Test Generation Subagent:**\n```\nInput: \n- File path to implementation\n- Function/class to test\n- Testing framework/patterns to use\n\nProcess:\n- Read implementation file\n- Generate comprehensive test cases\n- Write to test file\n\nOutput:\n- Success/failure message\n- Path to test file\n- Brief summary of test coverage\n\nPrimary agent gets: Small message, not full test code\n```\n\n**Research Subagent:**\n```\nInput:\n- Research question\n- Sources to check (docs URLs, codebase patterns, etc.)\n\nProcess:\n- Read documentation\n- Search codebase for examples\n- Synthesize findings\n\nOutput:\n- research.md with structured findings\n- Recommendations with evidence\n\nPrimary agent gets: Summary only, reads full file if needed\n```\n\nBoth fit the pattern: Output is much smaller than work performed, coordination is simple (task description + success/failure), primary agent doesn't need to see all the intermediate steps.",
